  "description": "PROPOSED UPGRADING OF 77 x. FLAT ENTRANCE DOORS TO ACHIEVE\r\nEQUIVALENCE OF FD30S FIRE RATING. PROPOSED WORKS TO THE DOORS INCLUDE: -\r\nREPLACING OVERHEAD DOOR CLOSERS, HINGES, LETTER PLATES AND LOCK SETS WITH FIRE\r\nRATED PRODUCTS - REPAIRING ANY DAMAGE TO DOORS AND ARCHITRAVES - INSTALLING\r\nINTUMESCENT SMOKE SEALS TO DOOR LEAF TOP AND SIDES. - APPLY WHITE INTUMESCENT\r\nPAINT TO THE INSIDE OF DOOR FRAMES AND ARCHITRAVE - REPLACE EXISTING LINING TO\r\nINSIDE FACE OF DOOR LEAF WITH NEW FIRE RATED LINING - ADJUSTING THE POSITION OF\r\nTHE FANLIGHT AND INSTALLING FIRE RATED SECONDARY GLAZING.",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify; &quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:&quot; arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=&quot;&quot; minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=&quot;&quot; ar-sa&quot;=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Commencement of development (CA Consent) &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;- The works hereby permitted\r\nshall be commenced before the expiration of 3 years from the date of this\r\nconsent.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:&quot; arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=&quot;&quot; minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=&quot;&quot; ar-sa&quot;=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:\r\n&quot; arial&quot;,sans-serif&quot;=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Reason&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;:  To comply\r\nwith Sections 18 (as amended) and 74 of the Planning (Listed Buildings and\r\nConservation Areas) Act 1990. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify; &quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:&quot; arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=&quot;&quot; minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=&quot;&quot; ar-sa&quot;=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Approved Plans&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt; - The development hereby permitted shall be carried out\r\nin accordance with the following approved plans: [insert plans]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:&quot; arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=&quot;&quot; minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=&quot;&quot; ar-sa&quot;=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Reason&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;: For the avoidance of doubt and in the interests of proper\r\nplanning&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
